<section class="mt-5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div><h2 class="font-bold">完整投标文件 AI 模拟审核</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">使用完整文本和评分标准原文，逐项建议单独留存并人工批准，不覆盖人工评分。</p></div><%= link_to "新建审核批次", new_bid_analysis_bid_simulation_path(@analysis), class: "rounded-md bg-cyan-800 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white" if policy(@analysis).update? %></div><% @analysis.bid_simulations.order(created_at: :desc).each do |simulation| %><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-100 pt-3 text-sm"><%= link_to simulation.title, simulation, class: "text-cyan-700" %><span><%= simulation.status == "reviewed" ? "已人工确认建议" : "待生成 / 待复核" %></span></div><% end %></section>
